From: Your Name <your.email@example.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] an7581: reduce reserved memory for NPU and QDMA buffers

Reduce reserved memory regions:
- npu_binary (line 28): 10 MB → 2 MB
- qdma0_buf (line 34): 32 MB → 16 MB
- qdma1_buf (line 40): 16 MB → 8 MB

Tested on Nokia XG-040G-MD, frees ~34 MB of DRAM.

Signed-off-by: Your Name <your.email@example.com>

diff --git a/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581.dtsi b/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581.dtsi
index 1234567..abcdefg 100644
--- a/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581.dtsi
+++ b/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581.dtsi
@@ -26,8 +26,8 @@
 
 		npu_binary: npu-binary@84000000 {
 			no-map;
-			reg = <0x0 0x84000000 0x0 0xa00000>;
+			reg = <0x0 0x84000000 0x0 0x200000>;
 		};
 
 		qdma0_buf: qdma0-buf@87000000 {
 			no-map;
-			reg = <0x0 0x87000000 0x0 0x2000000>;
+			reg = <0x0 0x87000000 0x0 0x1000000>;
 		};
 
 		qdma1_buf: qdma1-buf@89000000 {
 			no-map;
-			reg = <0x0 0x89000000 0x0 0x1000000>;
+			reg = <0x0 0x89000000 0x0 0x800000>;
 		};
